{"title": "Mind Flayer Reinforcements", "pageid": 57318, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Reinforcements", "categories": ["Class actions", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Unknown_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/e/ed/Unknown_Unfaded_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"63\" height=\"63\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Unknown_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Mind Flayer Reinforcements</b> is an artillery attack which spawns enemies in an area initially marked by white glowing circles.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>A pod containing a mind flayer plummets from the nautiloid. It creates a blast in a 2m radius, spawning one <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayers\" title=\"Mind flayers\">mind flayer</a> and two <a href=\"/wiki/Intellect_Devourer\" title=\"Intellect Devourer\">intellect devourers</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" d